Apply fit changes directly to the attached fit and persist them immediately — the change takes effect in the user's fit without further confirmation. Returns the applied/rejected edits plus the updated stats and validation issues. Edit ops: {"op":"add_module","slot_type":"high|medium|low|rig|subsystem|service|tactical_mode","type_id":<int>,"state":"active|online|passive|overload"?,"charge_type_id":<int>?}; {"op":"remove_module","slot_type":...,"index":<int>}; {"op":"set_module_charge","slot_type":...,"index":<int>,"charge_type_id":<int>?}; {"op":"set_module_state","slot_type":...,"index":<int>,"state":...}; {"op":"add_drone","type_id":<int>,"state":"bay|space"?} (default bay); {"op":"remove_drone","type_id":<int>} and {"op":"set_drone_state","type_id":<int>,"state":"bay|space"} apply to every drone of that type; {"op":"add_fighter","type_id":<int>,"ability":<int 0-15>?} (ability bitmask: 1 = attack turret, 2 = missiles, 4 = attack missile, 8 = bomb; add the values to combine several abilities, default 0 = none); {"op":"remove_fighter","type_id":<int>}; {"op":"set_implant","type_id":<int>,"slot":<1-10>} / {"op":"remove_implant","slot":<int>}; {"op":"set_booster","type_id":<int>,"slot":<1-3>} / {"op":"remove_booster","slot":<int>}. For implants and boosters take `slot` from the `slot_index` field of `search_items` results. Use `search_items` to resolve an item name to a `type_id` first.
